#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:5
#: f4813af50bb441d888abef2a1094884c
msgid "Sensor Testing"
msgstr "传感器测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:7
#: 5c2c286f7a03462a820e7c96b6a462f3
msgid ""
"This article shows how to check that the main main sensors (including "
"position and GPS) are working properly."
msgstr "本文介绍如何检查主要传感器（包括位置和GPS）是否正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:11
#: 65bed150ce584242ab996168ab2ebf08
msgid "Checking the main sensors"
msgstr "检查主要传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:13
#: f6d61fcdd01549c0ae13e2e569b735ae
msgid ""
"With *Mission Planner* connected, move the autopilot board and you should "
"see the artificial horizon move accordingly."
msgstr "连接 *Mission Planner* 后，移动飞控板，人工地平仪应相应移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:18
#: c5f706e1a73043adb4b3a9472d9cb2d3
msgid ""
"Remember how artificial horizons work: when the aircraft tilts to the right,"
" the horizon tilts to the left (tilt your head and you'll see what I mean). "
"This is normal!"
msgstr "请记住人工地平仪的工作原理：当飞机向右倾斜时，地平仪向左倾斜（倾斜头部就能理解）。这是正常的！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:22
#: b117c33f8abd4a559db2098c95de4850
msgid "In the screenshot below, the vehicle is tilted a bit to the right."
msgstr "下面的截图中，飞行器向右倾斜了一点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:24
#: 22cdb1323fcf4540bed0e97e3e1debaf
msgid ""
"The map will also show your current position using the GPS sensor if you "
"have the GPS module connected, are outside and have GPS lock."
msgstr "如果您已连接GPS模块、在室外且已获得GPS锁定，地图还将使用GPS传感器显示您的当前位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:28
#: 706afb0cb9d5474c84d538caa77b66cb
msgid "Display Sensor Data on Graph"
msgstr "在图表上显示传感器数据"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:30
#: b1f715a48ddb4a439499cb470fdcba3f
msgid ""
"You can see the output from all the various sensors by clicking on the "
"**Tuning** checkbox on the bottom right of the display **  1  ** This will "
"bring up the graphical sensor display."
msgstr "点击界面右下角的 **Tuning** （调参）复选框 **  1  ** 可查看所有各类传感器的输出，这将弹出图形传感器显示界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:34
#: 97558f9681734f8b97de231e2a9b4019
msgid ""
"If you click on the legend at the top of it **  2  ** , it will bring up a "
"window **\"Graph This\"** that allows you to choose which sensors and data "
"outputs to display."
msgstr "点击顶部的图例 **  2  **，将弹出 **「Graph This」** 窗口，允许选择要显示的传感器和数据输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sensor-testing.rst:44
#: 51c70ebec80a40aab6bfb5c8c6ec95b9
msgid "A video showing how to graph the sensor data is provided below:"
msgstr "以下提供了一个展示如何绘制传感器数据图表的视频："
